    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "NO. 5 AUBURN AVENUE\r\nMULLINGAR, CO. WESTMEATH · N91 V9T4\r\nA Stylishly Renovated Town-Centre Home\r\nPrice: €269,950\r\n\r\n3 Bedrooms · 1 Ensuite · Kitchen/Diner · Lounge · Sitting Room · Main Bathroom · Guest WC · Utility · Garden Shed · Parking\r\n\r\nA HOME IN THE HEART OF MULLINGAR\r\nLocated in a highly convenient town-centre position in Mullingar, No. 5 Auburn Avenue is a beautifully presented three-bedroom mid-terrace, two-storey house, offering comfortable accommodation in an exceptionally convenient setting.\r\n\r\nRecently renovated to a high standard, the property combines modern presentation with practical living space and is offered to the market fully furnished, making it an appealing choice for owner-occupiers, first-time buyers or investors.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is thoughtfully laid out over two floors and includes a welcoming entrance hall, guest WC, kitchen/diner, lounge, separate sitting room and utility area on the ground floor. Upstairs there are three bedrooms, including a main bedroom with ensuite, together with a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe property also benefits from oil-fired central heating, PVC double-glazed windows and doors, a full alarm system, private garden shed and parking.\r\n\r\nWith the convenience of Mullingar town centre close at hand, this is a property that offers an excellent balance of location, comfort and modern living.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall:\r\n3.75m x 1.00m\r\nWelcoming entrance with tiled flooring.\r\n\r\nGuest WC\r\n1.83m x 0.80m\r\nFully tiled with WC and wash hand basin.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Diner\r\n4.62m x 2.75m\r\nA practical and well-appointed kitchen/dining space featuring tiled flooring, fitted wall and floor units, electric oven and hob, and fridge freezer.\r\n\r\nLounge\r\n3.28m x 3.02m\r\nComfortable reception room with timber flooring and French doors leading through to the separate sitting room.\r\n\r\nSitting Room\r\n3.73m x 2.47m\r\nA versatile additional reception space with timber flooring, providing flexibility for family living, relaxation or entertaining.\r\n\r\nUtility\r\n1.58m x 1.00m\r\nConvenient utility area with tiled flooring and washer and dryer.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nLanding\r\n3.10m x 3.33m\r\nCarpeted landing with hotpress and immersion.\r\n\r\nMain Bedroom\r\n3.20m x 3.04m\r\nWell-proportioned principal bedroom with fitted carpet.\r\n\r\nEnsuite\r\n2.72m x 2.48m\r\nFully tiled ensuite featuring WC, wash hand basin and electric shower.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n2.75m x 2.48m\r\nComfortable second bedroom with fitted carpet.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n2.45m x 2.10m\r\nA further bedroom, also finished with fitted carpet.\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom\r\n3.00m x 1.71m\r\nFully tiled family bathroom with WC, wash hand basin and electric shower.\r\n\r\nThe property benefits from parking together with a block-built garden shed measuring approximately 2.60m x 1.60m, providing useful additional storage.\r\n\r\n\r\nTown-Centre Convenience\r\nOne of the standout features of No. 5 Auburn Avenue is its central Mullingar location.\r\n\r\nSituated within the town centre, the property places a wide range of everyday amenities and services within easy reach, including shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, professional services and local recreational facilities.\r\n\r\nFor those seeking the convenience of town-centre living, the location offers an excellent opportunity to enjoy Mullingar without compromising on comfortable residential accommodation.\r\n\r\nA TURNKEY HOME IN A CENTRAL LOCATION\r\nRecently renovated and presented in excellent order, No. 5 Auburn Avenue offers buyers the opportunity to acquire a ready-to-move-into, fully furnished three-bedroom home in a highly convenient part of Mullingar.\r\n\r\nWith its combination of modern finishes, versatile accommodation, three bedrooms, ensuite facilities, parking and an exceptional town-centre setting, this stunning property is well worth viewing!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Prime residential town-centre location\r\nRecently renovated to a high standard\r\nThree bedrooms\r\nMain bedroom with ensuite\r\nFully furnished\r\nKitchen/diner with fitted appliances\r\nSeparate lounge and sitting room\r\nUtility area\r\nGuest WC\r\nMain family bathroom\r\nOil-fired heating system\r\nPVC double-glazed windows and doors\r\nFull alarm system\r\nCarpets, curtains, blinds and light fittings included\r\nPrivate garden shed\r\nParking"
